Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.33,0:23:30.81,EDJP,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(0,0)\blur0\bord0\c&H00EDEDED\p1\an5\pos(960,30)}m 0 0 l 1950 0 l 1950 150 l 0 150
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.41,0:22:09.79,EDJP,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(200,200)\blur10.5\an9}君の横顔が
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.25,0:22:13.55,EDJP,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(200,200)\blur10.5\an9}見つめているのは
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.05,0:22:18.01,EDJP,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(200,200)\blur10.5\an9}次の季節だと
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.26,0:22:23.56,EDJP,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(200,200)\blur10.5\an9}分かってるから
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.22,0:22:27.68,EDJP,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(200,200)\blur10.5\an9}痛いくらいに
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.44,0:22:34.11,EDJP,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(200,200)\blur10.5\an9}反射的に笑顔つくる
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.23,0:22:43.07,EDJP,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(200,200)\blur0\brod0\c&H00000000}曖昧な線　揺れた隙間で
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.87,0:22:52.08,EDJP,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(200,200)\blur0\brod0\c&H00000000}無邪気なあざとさで　夢を繋いだの
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.46,0:22:57.51,EDJP,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(200,200)\\blur0\brod0\c&H00000000}嘘だらけで
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.26,0:23:01.38,EDJP,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(200,200)\blur0\brod0\c&H00000000}傷だらけで
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.05,0:23:07.89,EDJP,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(200,200)\blur0\brod0\c&H00000000}純度だけは高くて
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.31,0:23:13.23,EDJP,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(200,200)\blur0\brod0\c&H00000000}ほら　まぶしすぎて
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.23,0:23:16.02,EDJP,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(200,200)\blur0\brod0\c&H00000000}涙ダイヤモンド
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.27,0:23:22.99,EDJP,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(200,200)\blur0\brod0\c&H00000000}きっと終わりが始まってる
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.87,0:23:30.71,EDJP,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(200,200)\blur0\brod0\c&H00000000}ずっと忘れない季節でしょう
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,//------------------EDTW-------------------
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.41,0:22:09.79,EDTW,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(200,200)\blur10.5\an9}看著你的側臉
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.25,0:22:13.55,EDTW,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(200,200)\blur10.5\an9}所注視著的
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.05,0:22:18.01,EDTW,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(200,200)\blur10.5\an9}是下個季節
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.26,0:22:23.56,EDTW,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(200,200)\blur10.5\an9}我明白的
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.22,0:22:27.68,EDTW,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(200,200)\blur10.5\an9}痛徹心扉
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.44,0:22:34.11,EDTW,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(200,200)\blur10.5\an9}卻反射似的故做笑容
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.23,0:22:43.07,EDTW,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(200,200)\blur0\brod0\c&H00000000}曖昧的線條在搖動的縫隙中
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.87,0:22:52.08,EDTW,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(200,200)\blur0\brod0\c&H00000000}用天真的小聰明 連結著夢境
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.46,0:22:57.51,EDTW,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(200,200)\blur0\brod0\c&H00000000}滿是謊言
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.26,0:23:01.38,EDTW,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(200,200)\blur0\brod0\c&H00000000}遍體磷傷
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.05,0:23:07.89,EDTW,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(200,200)\blur0\brod0\c&H00000000}只有純度高過一切
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.31,0:23:13.23,EDTW,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(200,200)\\blur0\brod0\c&H00000000}看啊 多麼地耀眼
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.23,0:23:16.02,EDTW,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(200,200)\blur0\brod0\c&H00000000}淚水結成的鑽石
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.27,0:23:22.99,EDTW,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(200,200)\blur0\brod0\c&H00000000}一切的終結就要開始
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.87,0:23:30.71,EDTW,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(200,200)\blur0\brod0\c&H00000000}這永遠無法忘記的季節
